{"seq":3,"slug":"reform-and-opening-up","title":"改革开放","stage":"DONE","category":"deng-xiaoping-theory","categoryLabel":"邓小平理论","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/reform-and-opening-up","rating":{"composite":3.5,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.67,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/02_deng-xiaoping-theory/03_reform-and-opening-up","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"改革开放-简介\">改革开放 简介</h1><p>改革开放是二十世纪后半叶中国最重要的历史转折，是邓小平理论在实践层面最集中的体现。自一九七八年十一届三中全会启动以来，改革开放从根本上改变了中国的经济结构、社会面貌和国际地位，创造了人类历史上罕见的经济增长奇迹。</p>\n<p>本知识库适用于希望系统理解改革开放全过程的读者，包括经济学、政治学研究者，关注中国发展模式的国际观察者，以及希望从历史中汲取治理智慧的实务工作者。</p>\n<p>全书共分三章，从决策到实施再到开放，完整勾画改革开放的历史脉络。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>决策背景</strong>，深入分析改革开放启动的历史动因。从文化大革命的惨痛教训到国际格局的深刻变化，从十一届三中全会的历史性转折到邓小平复出后的战略谋划，揭示这场伟大变革的历史必然性与偶然性。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>经济体制改革</strong>，聚焦国内经济领域的变革历程。从农村联产承包责任制的突破到经济特区战略的实施，从价格改革的艰难探索到城市经济体制的全面转型，展现改革从农村到城市、从局部到全局的推进逻辑。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>对外开放</strong>，系统阐述中国融入世界经济体系的过程。从引进外资的初步尝试到贸易自由化的稳步推进，从技术引进消化吸收到全方位、多层次、宽领域的开放格局形成，呈现中国对外开放的战略智慧。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径为：先读第一章理解决策逻辑，再并行阅读第二章和第三章，体会内部改革与外部开放的互动关系。学习过程中建议结合中国经济统计数据，用实证视角审视改革成效。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"decision-background","title":"决策背景","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/reform-and-opening-up/decision-background","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cultural-revolution-lessons","title":"\"文化大革命\"的历史教训","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/reform-and-opening-up/decision-background/cultural-revolution-lessons"},{"seq":2,"slug":"global-context","title":"改革开放的国际背景","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/reform-and-opening-up/decision-background/global-context"},{"seq":3,"slug":"third-plenum-turning-point","title":"十一届三中全会的历史转折","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/reform-and-opening-up/decision-background/third-plenum-turning-point"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"economic-reform","title":"经济体制改革","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/reform-and-opening-up/economic-reform","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rural-reform","title":"农村改革：联产承包的制度突破","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/reform-and-opening-up/economic-reform/rural-reform"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sez-strategy","title":"经济特区战略","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/reform-and-opening-up/economic-reform/sez-strategy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"price-reform","title":"价格改革：从计划定价到市场调节","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/reform-and-opening-up/economic-reform/price-reform"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"opening-policy","title":"对外开放","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/reform-and-opening-up/opening-policy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foreign-investment","title":"外资引进：对外开放的关键引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/reform-and-opening-up/opening-policy/foreign-investment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"trade-liberalization","title":"贸易自由化：融入世界经济体系","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/reform-and-opening-up/opening-policy/trade-liberalization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"technology-introduction","title":"技术引进：从模仿到创新的发展路径","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/reform-and-opening-up/opening-policy/technology-introduction"}]}]}